# A4 ARAL admin. Part 1 (2026-10-23): Key Stage 1 follows DepEd Memorandum
# 064 s. 2025 (migration 20261023030000): Low/High Emerging join; Developing
# and Transitioning only with the school's extended program (ks1_extended,
# off by default) and otherwise leave with classroom support; the CRLA in the
# grade's language counts (Grade 2: Filipino). The rest of A4 (roster admin,
# transfers, classes) follows the ARAL classes design.
#
# Grade 2 learners and their latest Filipino BOSY CRLA (T3's results, imported
# onto the server by A2):
#   s_g2_1 Reading At Grade Level, s_g2_2 Low Emerging, s_g2_3 High Emerging,
#   s_g2_4 Transitioning.
# The batch removes the roster entries it makes (synced), so it reruns.

device a4-pc admin fresh
as coord
run pull-cloud yes
expect users:

# --- The switch ----------------------------------------------------------------
run aral-ks1-extended {school}
expect Applies: off (KS1 takes Low/High Emerging learners)
run aral-ks1-extended-set region on
refuse Forbidden: only the superadmin sets the region-wide ARAL settings.
run aral-ks1-extended-set {schoolB} on
refuse Forbidden: you can only change your own school's ARAL settings.
run aral-ks1-extended-set {school} maybe
refuse Usage: aral-ks1-extended-set <region|schoolId> <on|off>

# --- Proposal, switch off ---------------------------------------------------------
run aral-propose {sec_g2} {year}
# Low and High Emerging only; Transitioning stays in the regular class.
expect | {s_g2_2} | ZZTESTB, Learner002 | proposed -> KS1 | CRLA BOSY Filipino: Low Emerging Reader
# F12: 36/96 = 37.5% and 60/96 = 62.5% of the words (round half up).
expect | {s_g2_3} | ZZTESTC, Learner003 | proposed -> KS1 | CRLA BOSY Filipino: High Emerging Reader (38% words correct, comprehension 0, 27 wpm)
expect | {s_g2_1} | ZZTESTA, Learner001 | notQualified | CRLA BOSY Filipino: Reading At Grade Level (not ARAL)
expect | {s_g2_4} | ZZTESTD, Learner004 | notQualified | CRLA BOSY Filipino: Transitioning Reader (not ARAL: regular class; the school's extended KS1 program is off) (63% words correct, comprehension 4, 40 wpm)

# --- Switch on: Transitioning is proposed too ---------------------------------------
run aral-ks1-extended-set {school} on
expect Extended KS1 program on for school {school}. Developing/Transitioning learners are proposed for ARAL from now on.
run aral-ks1-extended {school}
expect School {school}: on
expect Applies: on (Developing/Transitioning join KS1 too)
run pull-cloud yes
expect users:
run aral-propose {sec_g2} {year}
expect~ \| {s_g2_4} \| ZZTESTD, Learner004 \| proposed -> KS1 \| CRLA BOSY Filipino: Transitioning Reader
run aral-enroll {sec_g2} {year} {s_g2_4}
expect ZZTESTD, Learner004 ({s_g2_4}) | KS1 | active | unplaced | basis: crla bosy Transitioning Reader
capture e_g2_4 = On the ARAL roster: #(-?\d+)
run aral-enroll {sec_g2} {year} {s_g2_3}
expect ZZTESTC, Learner003 ({s_g2_3}) | KS1 | active | unplaced | basis: crla bosy High Emerging Reader
capture e_g2_3 = On the ARAL roster: #(-?\d+)
run aral-enroll {sec_g2} {year} {s_g2_2}
expect ZZTESTB, Learner002 ({s_g2_2}) | KS1 | active | unplaced | basis: crla bosy Low Emerging Reader
capture e_g2_2 = On the ARAL roster: #(-?\d+)

# --- A MOSY result for s_g2_3: High Emerging -> Developing ---------------------------
run crla-start {s_g2_3} {sec_g2} {year} fil mosy Tagalog
capture a4_mosy = Started assessment (-?\d+)
run crla-part1 {a4_mosy} {=8} {=5}
expect total 23, level Light Refresher.
# Story 1 (96 words), 36 miscues = 60 words read in 1:30 = 40.0 wpm, 62.5%;
# comprehension 2 -> Developing (T3's s_g2_4: same reading, comprehension 4
# -> Transitioning).
run crla-part2 {a4_mosy} {=1} {=36} {=1} {=30} {=2}
expect 60 words read, wpm 40.0.
expect | P2 story 1 wpm 40.0 comp 2 words 62.5% | Developing Reader

# --- Switch off again: Developing/Transitioning leave with classroom support ---------
# (any round: s_g2_4 on its BOSY, s_g2_3 on its MOSY; Low Emerging stays).
run aral-ks1-extended-set {school} off
expect Extended KS1 program off for school {school}. Developing/Transitioning ARAL learners leave with classroom support at the next aral-update.
run pull-cloud yes
expect users:
run aral-enroll {sec_g2} {year} {s_g2_1}
refuse ZZTESTA, Learner001 is not for ARAL-Reading: CRLA BOSY Filipino: Reading At Grade Level (not ARAL)
run aral-update {sec_g2} {year}
expect | ZZTESTB, Learner002 | unchanged | CRLA BOSY Filipino (Low Emerging Reader): nothing new
expect | ZZTESTC, Learner003 | exited | CRLA MOSY Filipino (Developing Reader): leaves ARAL with classroom support (the extended KS1 program is off), exited on {today}
expect | ZZTESTD, Learner004 | exited | CRLA BOSY Filipino (Transitioning Reader): leaves ARAL with classroom support (the extended KS1 program is off), exited on {today}

# --- By hand: reactivate, exit with classroom support -------------------------------
run aral-reactivate {e_g2_4}
expect | ZZTESTD, Learner004 ({s_g2_4}) | KS1 | active |
run aral-exit {e_g2_4} classroom_support
expect | ZZTESTD, Learner004 ({s_g2_4}) | KS1 | exited {today} (classroom_support) |
run aral-exit {e_g2_3} graduated
refuse Usage: aral-exit <enrollmentId> <transferred_out|dropped_out|other|classroom_support> [YYYY-MM-DD]

# --- The server takes the new exit reason --------------------------------------------
run sync-upload yes
expect~ [Aa]pplied
run pull-cloud yes
expect users:
run aral-roster {sec_g2} {year}
expect~ \| ZZTESTC, Learner003 \({s_g2_3}\) \| KS1 \| exited {today} \(classroom_support\)
expect~ \| ZZTESTD, Learner004 \({s_g2_4}\) \| KS1 \| exited {today} \(classroom_support\)
expect 3 on the roster, 1 active, 1 waiting for a class.
run aral-report {school} {year} {sec_g2}
expect | exited 2 (grade-level ready 0, other 2) |

# --- Clean up (synced), so the batch reruns ------------------------------------------
run aral-roster {sec_g2} {year}
capture e_g2_4s = #(\d+) \| [^\n]*\({s_g2_4}\)
capture e_g2_3s = #(\d+) \| [^\n]*\({s_g2_3}\)
capture e_g2_2s = #(\d+) \| [^\n]*\({s_g2_2}\)
run aral-remove {e_g2_2s}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_g2_2s}.
run aral-remove {e_g2_4s}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_g2_4s}.
run aral-remove {e_g2_3s}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_g2_3s}.
run sync-upload yes
expect~ [Aa]pplied

# --- Tutors can read the switch; signed out nothing works ------------------------------
device a4-phone tutor fresh
as tutor1
run aral-ks1-extended {school}
expect Applies: off (KS1 takes Low/High Emerging learners)
device a4-pc admin
run sign-out
expect Signed out.
run aral-ks1-extended {school}
refuse Not signed in. Sign in first.
run aral-ks1-extended-set {school} on
refuse Not signed in. Sign in first.

# ====================================================================================
# A4 part 2 (2026-10-24): ARAL classes (spec docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-23-aral-
# classes-design.md, home grade + one program or mixed). A class holds at most 15
# active learners of one school and year; a learner of another grade only with the
# coordinator's other-grade confirmation; sessions per class. Section ZZTEST-G7C
# (16 Grade 7 learners, LRNs ...7101-7116) is imported here for the 15 cap.
# Everything made here is removed at the end (synced), so the batch reruns.
#   cb = "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}" (Grade 7, KS3 Basic, tutor2); class_1 = B0's
#   "ZZ 7-Rose" (Grade 7, mixed, tutor1, 3 learners).

device a4-pc admin
as coord
run pull-cloud yes
expect users:

# --- Section G7C ------------------------------------------------------------------
make-sf1 sf1_g7c a 7 ZZTEST-G7C 16 from=101
run import-students "{sf1_g7c}"
expect~ Inserted: (16|0), Conflicts: 0
run section-list
capture sec_g7c = (\d+) \| 7 - ZZTEST-G7C \({year}\)
run student-list-section {sec_g7c}
capture s_c1 = (\d+) \| 9990\d{4}7101
capture s_c2 = (\d+) \| 9990\d{4}7102
capture s_c3 = (\d+) \| 9990\d{4}7103
capture s_c4 = (\d+) \| 9990\d{4}7104
capture s_c5 = (\d+) \| 9990\d{4}7105
capture s_c6 = (\d+) \| 9990\d{4}7106
capture s_c7 = (\d+) \| 9990\d{4}7107
capture s_c8 = (\d+) \| 9990\d{4}7108
capture s_c9 = (\d+) \| 9990\d{4}7109
capture s_c10 = (\d+) \| 9990\d{4}7110
capture s_c11 = (\d+) \| 9990\d{4}7111
capture s_c12 = (\d+) \| 9990\d{4}7112
capture s_c13 = (\d+) \| 9990\d{4}7113
capture s_c14 = (\d+) \| 9990\d{4}7114
capture s_c15 = (\d+) \| 9990\d{4}7115
capture s_c16 = (\d+) \| 9990\d{4}7116
run pull-cloud yes
expect users:

# --- Class admin ----------------------------------------------------------------------
run aral-class-add {school} {year} {=7} ks3_basic ZZ A4 Basic {stamp} tutor={tutor2_id} "room=Room 4" "schedule=MWF 9-10"
expect | ZZ A4 Basic {stamp} | Grade 7, KS3 Basic | tutor {tutor2_id} | room Room 4 | MWF 9-10 | 0/15 active
capture cb = ARAL class added: #(-\d+)
run aral-class-add {school} {year} {=12} mixed ZZ Too High
refuse ARAL-Reading classes are for Grades 1-10.
run aral-class-add {school} {year} {=7} ks2 ZZ Bad Program
refuse Unknown program "ks2"
run aral-class-add {school} {year} {=7} mixed zz a4 basic {stamp}
refuse A class named "zz a4 basic {stamp}" already exists for {year}.
run aral-class-add {schoolB} {year} {=7} mixed ZZ Other School
refuse Forbidden: that school is not yours.
run aral-class-add {school} {year} {=7} mixed ZZ Tutor From B tutor={coord_id}
refuse The class tutor must be an active tutor of the school.
run aral-class-edit {cb} notes ZZ A4 notes
expect ARAL class saved: #{cb} | ZZ A4 Basic {stamp} |
run aral-class-edit {cb} tutor -
expect | tutor - | room Room 4 |
run aral-class-edit {cb} tutor {tutor2_id}
expect | tutor {tutor2_id} |
run aral-class-edit {cb} grade {=13}
refuse ARAL-Reading classes are for Grades 1-10.
run aral-class-edit {cb} colour red
refuse Usage: aral-class-edit
run aral-class-show {cb}
expect notes: ZZ A4 notes
expect (no learners yet)

# --- A teacher's referral: who and why are required; program picked by hand -----------
run aral-refer {sec_g7} {year} {s_g7_4} ks1 "reason=ZZ reads slowly"
refuse A referral needs who referred the learner and why.
run aral-refer {sec_g7} {year} {s_g7_4} ks1 "by=ZZ Teacher Cruz" "reason=ZZ reads slowly" class={cb}
expect | KS1 | active | unplaced | basis: referral by ZZ Teacher Cruz: ZZ reads slowly
expect Warning: ZZTESTD, Learner004 is in KS1; class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}" is KS3 Basic. ZZTESTD, Learner004 is on the roster without a class.
capture e_ref = On the ARAL roster: #(-?\d+)
# KS1 does not fit the KS3 Basic class: the learner waits; the mixed class takes them.
run aral-class-place {e_ref} {cb}
refuse ZZTESTD, Learner004 is in KS1; class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}" is KS3 Basic.
run aral-class-place {e_ref} {class_1}
expect placed in #{class_1} | ZZ 7-Rose | Grade 7, mixed programs | tutor {tutor1_id} | 4/15 active

# --- 14 learners in cb, uploaded --------------------------------------------------------
run aral-enroll {sec_g7c} {year} {s_c1} ks3 basic class={cb} entered={past}
expect class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
run aral-enroll {sec_g7c} {year} {s_c2} ks3 basic class={cb} entered={past}
expect class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
run aral-enroll {sec_g7c} {year} {s_c3} ks3 basic class={cb} entered={past}
expect class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
run aral-enroll {sec_g7c} {year} {s_c4} ks3 basic class={cb} entered={past}
expect class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
run aral-enroll {sec_g7c} {year} {s_c5} ks3 basic class={cb} entered={past}
expect class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
run aral-enroll {sec_g7c} {year} {s_c6} ks3 basic class={cb} entered={past}
expect class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
run aral-enroll {sec_g7c} {year} {s_c7} ks3 basic class={cb} entered={past}
expect class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
run aral-enroll {sec_g7c} {year} {s_c8} ks3 basic class={cb} entered={past}
expect class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
run aral-enroll {sec_g7c} {year} {s_c9} ks3 basic class={cb} entered={past}
expect class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
run aral-enroll {sec_g7c} {year} {s_c10} ks3 basic class={cb} entered={past}
expect class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
run aral-enroll {sec_g7c} {year} {s_c11} ks3 basic class={cb} entered={past}
expect class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
run aral-enroll {sec_g7c} {year} {s_c12} ks3 basic class={cb} entered={past}
expect class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
run aral-enroll {sec_g7c} {year} {s_c13} ks3 basic class={cb} entered={past}
expect class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
run aral-enroll {sec_g7c} {year} {s_c14} ks3 basic class={cb} entered={past}
expect class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
run aral-classes {school} {year}
expect | ZZ A4 Basic {stamp} | Grade 7, KS3 Basic | tutor {tutor2_id} | room Room 4 | MWF 9-10 | 14/15 active
run sync-upload yes
expect~ [Aa]pplied
run aral-classes {school} {year}
capture cb_srv = #(\d+) \| ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}
run aral-roster {sec_g7c} {year}
capture e_c1 = #(\d+) \| [^|]*Learner101 
capture e_c2 = #(\d+) \| [^|]*Learner102 
capture e_c3 = #(\d+) \| [^|]*Learner103 
capture e_c4 = #(\d+) \| [^|]*Learner104 
capture e_c5 = #(\d+) \| [^|]*Learner105 
capture e_c6 = #(\d+) \| [^|]*Learner106 
capture e_c7 = #(\d+) \| [^|]*Learner107 
capture e_c8 = #(\d+) \| [^|]*Learner108 
capture e_c9 = #(\d+) \| [^|]*Learner109 
capture e_c10 = #(\d+) \| [^|]*Learner110 
capture e_c11 = #(\d+) \| [^|]*Learner111 
capture e_c12 = #(\d+) \| [^|]*Learner112 
capture e_c13 = #(\d+) \| [^|]*Learner113 
capture e_c14 = #(\d+) \| [^|]*Learner114 
run aral-roster {sec_g7} {year}
capture e_ref_srv = #(\d+) \| [^|]*\({s_g7_4}\)

# --- Review Focus 1: the cap holds when two devices place the 15th learner ----------------
# a4-pc2 places learner 15 and uploads; a4-pc (still seeing 14) places learner 16:
# its upload is refused at apply with a readable message.
device a4-pc2 admin fresh
as coord
run pull-cloud yes
expect users:
run aral-enroll {sec_g7c} {year} {s_c15} ks3 basic class={cb_srv} entered={past}
expect class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
run sync-upload yes
expect~ [Aa]pplied

device a4-pc admin
run aral-enroll {sec_g7c} {year} {s_c16} ks3 basic class={cb_srv} entered={past}
expect class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
capture e_c16_dev = On the ARAL roster: #(-?\d+)
run sync-upload yes
expect~ an ARAL class has at most 15 active learners
run sync-status
expect~ error .*an ARAL class has at most 15 active learners
# Fixed on the device: learner 16 waits for a class, then the upload goes through.
run aral-class-unplace {e_c16_dev}
expect ARAL learner #{e_c16_dev} now waits for a class.
run sync-upload yes
expect~ [Aa]pplied
run pull-cloud yes
expect users:
run aral-roster {sec_g7c} {year}
capture e_c15 = #(\d+) \| [^|]*Learner115
capture e_c16 = #(\d+) \| [^|]*Learner116
expect 16 on the roster, 16 active, 1 waiting for a class.
run aral-class-place {e_c16} {cb_srv}
refuse Class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}" already has 15 active ARAL learners.

# --- Review Focus 1: two offline classes with the same name -------------------------------
run aral-class-add {school} {year} {=7} mixed ZZ Dup {stamp}
capture dup_1 = ARAL class added: #(-\d+)
device a4-pc2 admin
run aral-class-add {school} {year} {=7} mixed ZZ Dup {stamp}
expect ARAL class added
run sync-upload yes
expect~ [Aa]pplied
device a4-pc admin
run sync-upload yes
expect~ an ARAL class named "ZZ Dup {stamp}" already exists in this school for {year}
expect~ can be changed again
run aral-class-edit {dup_1} name ZZ Dup B {stamp}
expect | ZZ Dup B {stamp} |
run sync-upload yes
expect~ [Aa]pplied

# --- A session in cb (the coordinator logs it for tutor2), every learner present ---------
run aral-log {cb_srv} {=40} pull_out tutor={tutor2_id} lesson "ZZ A4 cb"
expect | class #{cb_srv} | session 1 | {today} | 40 min | Pull-out | tutor {tutor2_id} | ZZ A4 cb
capture cb_ses_dev = Logged: #(-?\d+)
run aral-mark-rest {cb_ses_dev} present
expect Marked 15 learner(s) present.
run sync-upload yes
expect~ [Aa]pplied
run aral-class-sessions {cb_srv}
capture cb_ses = #(\d+) \| class #{cb_srv} \| session 1 \|

# --- Reactivating into a full class: back without a class --------------------------------
run aral-exit {e_c1} other
expect | exited {today} (other) | class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
run aral-class-place {e_c16} {cb_srv}
expect placed in #{cb_srv} | ZZ A4 Basic {stamp} | Grade 7, KS3 Basic | tutor {tutor2_id} | room Room 4 | MWF 9-10 | 15/15 active
run aral-reactivate {e_c1}
expect | KS3 Basic | active | unplaced |
expect Warning: Class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}" is full, so this learner is back without a class. Place them in a class (aral-class-place).
run aral-class-place {e_c1} {class_1}
expect placed in #{class_1} | ZZ 7-Rose | Grade 7, mixed programs | tutor {tutor1_id} | 5/15 active

# --- A program change keeps the learner in class, flagged ----------------------------------
run aral-placement {e_c3} ks2 basic
expect | KS2 Basic | active | class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
run aral-update {sec_g7c} {year}
expect #{e_c3} | ZZTESTY, Learner103 | programMismatch | program now KS2 Basic: move to a KS2 Basic class (class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}" is KS3 Basic)
expect 1 in a class of another program
run aral-placement {e_c3} ks3 basic
expect | KS3 Basic | active | class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"

# --- Another grade: never automatic, only with the coordinator's confirmation ---------------
run aral-enroll-proposed {sec_g2} {year} class={class_1}
expect Added 2 learner(s):
expect ZZTESTB, Learner002 ({s_g2_2}): ZZTESTB, Learner002 is in Grade 2; class "ZZ 7-Rose" is for Grade 7.
run aral-roster {sec_g2} {year}
capture e_g2p = #(-?\d+) \| [^|]*\({s_g2_2}\)
run aral-class-place {e_g2p} {class_1}
refuse ZZTESTB, Learner002 is in Grade 2; class "ZZ 7-Rose" is for Grade 7. Place them in it anyway with other-grade if you decide so.
run aral-class-place {e_g2p} {class_1} other-grade
expect placed in #{class_1} | ZZ 7-Rose | Grade 7, mixed programs | tutor {tutor1_id} | 6/15 active
run aral-update {sec_g2} {year}
expect | ZZTESTB, Learner002 | otherGrade | Grade 2 in class "ZZ 7-Rose" (Grade 7)
expect 1 in a class of another grade
run reminders-coordinator {school} {year}
expect [ARAL] 1 ARAL learner in a class of another grade.
expect~ 9990\d{8}  ZZTESTB, Learner002  \(ARAL #-?\d+\)

# --- An SF1 section move inside the school (same grade): aral-move follows it --------------
make-sf1 sf1_mv a 7 ZZTEST-G7M{stamp} 1 from=116
run import-students "{sf1_mv}"
expect Inserted: 0, Conflicts: 1, Already enrolled: 0, Skipped: 0
run resolve-conflicts-all update
expect~ .
run aral-move {e_c15}
refuse ZZTESTK, Learner115 is already in section {sec_g7c}.
run aral-move {e_c16}
expect Updated: #{e_c16} | ZZTESTL, Learner116 ({s_c16}) | KS3 Basic | active | class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
run sync-upload yes
expect~ [Aa]pplied

# --- The new class tutor reads the moved learner's marks in the old class's session --------
run aral-class-place {e_c2} {class_1}
expect placed in #{class_1} | ZZ 7-Rose | Grade 7, mixed programs | tutor {tutor1_id} | 7/15 active
run sync-upload yes
expect~ [Aa]pplied
device a4-t1 tutor fresh
as tutor1
run pull-cloud yes
expect users:
run aral-attendance {e_c2}
expect class #{cb_srv} | session 1 | {today} | tutor {tutor2_id} | present
expect 1 present, 0 absent, 0 excused (100% attendance)
# e_c1 and e_c2 both left cb for class_1: tutor1 sees their two marks only.
# The old class's session is reached through the learner's marks, not listed
# as one of tutor1's sessions.
run aral-sessions
expect No ARAL sessions.
sql select count(*) from aral_attendance where session_id = {cb_ses} => 2
sql select count(*) from aral_sessions where id = {cb_ses} => 1

# --- The class tutor assesses a learner of a section they are not assigned to --------------
device a4-t2 tutor fresh
as tutor2
run pull-cloud yes
expect users:
run aral-roster tutor
expect #{e_c16} | ZZTESTL, Learner116 ({s_c16}) | KS3 Basic | active | class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}"
# A failing score, so the learner stays an ARAL learner on reruns.
run phil-iri-gst {s_c4} {sec_g7c} {year} 10
expect 10/40
# A learner who left tutor2's class is not on their device.
run phil-iri-gst {s_c2} {sec_g7c} {year} 25
refuse Learner has no active enrollment in this section for that school year.
run sync-upload yes
expect waiting for approval.
capture up_a4t2 = Upload (\d+)
device a4-pc admin
run sync-approve {up_a4t2}
expect Upload {up_a4t2} applied.

# --- Clean up (synced), so the batch reruns ------------------------------------------------
# The moved learner goes back to G7C (SF1), the session and the roster rows go,
# then the classes.
run import-students "{sf1_g7c}"
expect~ Conflicts: 1
run resolve-conflicts-all update
expect~ .
run pull-cloud yes
expect users:
run aral-class-delete {cb_srv}
refuse Class "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}" still has learners or sessions; it can't be deleted.
run aral-session-delete {cb_ses}
expect Deleted ARAL session {cb_ses}.
run aral-remove {e_c1}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_c1}.
run aral-remove {e_c2}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_c2}.
run aral-remove {e_c3}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_c3}.
run aral-remove {e_c4}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_c4}.
run aral-remove {e_c5}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_c5}.
run aral-remove {e_c6}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_c6}.
run aral-remove {e_c7}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_c7}.
run aral-remove {e_c8}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_c8}.
run aral-remove {e_c9}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_c9}.
run aral-remove {e_c10}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_c10}.
run aral-remove {e_c11}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_c11}.
run aral-remove {e_c12}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_c12}.
run aral-remove {e_c13}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_c13}.
run aral-remove {e_c14}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_c14}.
run aral-remove {e_c15}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_c15}.
run aral-remove {e_c16}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_c16}.
run aral-remove {e_ref_srv}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_ref_srv}.
run aral-roster {sec_g2} {year}
capture e_g2p_s = #(\d+) \| [^|]*\({s_g2_2}\)
capture e_g2q_s = #(\d+) \| [^|]*\({s_g2_3}\)
run aral-remove {e_g2p_s}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_g2p_s}.
run aral-remove {e_g2q_s}
expect Removed ARAL enrollment {e_g2q_s}.
run aral-classes {school} {year}
capture dup_a = #(\d+) \| ZZ Dup {stamp} \|
capture dup_b = #(\d+) \| ZZ Dup B {stamp} \|
run aral-class-delete {cb_srv}
expect ARAL class #{cb_srv} "ZZ A4 Basic {stamp}" deleted.
run aral-class-delete {dup_a}
expect~ .
run aral-class-delete {dup_b}
expect~ .
run sync-upload yes
expect~ [Aa]pplied
run aral-classes {school} {year}
expect #{class_1} | ZZ 7-Rose | Grade 7, mixed programs | tutor {tutor1_id} | 3/15 active

# --- Signed out: every class and roster admin command refuses -------------------------------
